        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023/457, Industrial Hanger 18 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt 18-1/2 inches overall length, the Omnia made 9023/457 cabinet door pull is good for use on more than just cabinets. This pull can be used on light-weight drawers and doors all over your home. Try sprucing up your dresser or updating your entertainment center. The 18 Inch Hangar Cabinet Pull is available in modern finishes that accent the industrial chic design. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9023\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9023 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 28-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
